"""Fail-closed detection-floor extraction fixtures (2026-07-19 audit T0.4/T0.6).

The four cooldown cap-hit fixtures below are the REAL campaign-provenance
records from the 2026-07-19 recalibration corpora (recal4 su-b01-b1, recal5
short-prefill r04 and long-prompt r03, recal6 ph-prefill b03-b1), embedded
verbatim together with their raw cooldown trace bytes.  Each raw payload is
re-hashed in the tests against the record's own ``raw_artifact.sha256`` pin,
so a hand-simplified or drifted fixture fails immediately.
"""

